        "text": "Section 4 - Key Decisions\nKey Decisions\nRole\nApprove an internal or external secondment\nVice-Chancellor"
    },
    {
        "chunk_id": "52-5",
        "document_id": "52",
        "policy_title": "Secondment Procedure",
        "heading_level": "h3",
        "section": "Section 5 - Procedures",
        "subsection": null,
        "topic": "Internal Secondments - Eligibility",
        "subtopic": null,
        "paragraph_start": 6,
        "paragraph_end": 8,
        "source_url": "https://policies.latrobe.edu.au/document/view.php?id=52",
        "status_details_url": "https://policies.latrobe.edu.au/document/status-and-details.php?id=52",
        "status": "Current",
        "effective_date": "4th July 2025",
        "review_date": "4th July 2028",
        "approval_authority": "Vice-Chancellor",
        "approval_date": "4th July 2025",
        "version": null,
        "text": "Internal Secondments - Eligibility\n(6)\nContinuing staff are eligible to apply for any secondment opportunities.\n(7)\nCasual staff are not eligible for secondments.\n(8)\nStaff on fixed term appointments are not eligible for secondments."
    },
    {
        "chunk_id": "52-6",
        "document_id": "52",
        "policy_title": "Secondment Procedure",
        "heading_level": "h3",
        "section": "Section 5 - Procedures",
        "subsection": null,
        "topic": "Length of Secondment",
        "subtopic": null,
        "paragraph_start": 9,
        "paragraph_end": 9,
        "source_url": "https://policies.latrobe.edu.au/document/view.php?id=52",
        "status_details_url": "https://policies.latrobe.edu.au/document/status-and-details.php?id=52",
        "status": "Current",
        "effective_date": "4th July 2025",
        "review_date": "4th July 2028",
        "approval_authority": "Vice-Chancellor",
        "approval_date": "4th July 2025",
        "version": null,
        "text": "Length of Secondment\n(9)\nInternal secondments must be a minimum of three (3) months and up to an initial twelve (12) month period and will be reviewed at the conclusion of that period. Up to a further twelve (12) month extension can be negotiated between Hiring Managers."
    },
    {
        "chunk_id": "52-7",
        "document_id": "52",
        "policy_title": "Secondment Procedure",
        "heading_level": "h3",
        "section": "Section 5 - Procedures",
        "subsection": null,
        "topic": "Costs",
        "subtopic": null,
        "paragraph_start": 10,
        "paragraph_end": 10,
        "source_url": "https://policies.latrobe.edu.au/document/view.php?id=52",
        "status_details_url": "https://policies.latrobe.edu.au/document/status-and-details.php?id=52",
        "status": "Current",
        "effective_date": "4th July 2025",
        "review_date": "4th July 2028",
        "approval_authority": "Vice-Chancellor",
        "approval_date": "4th July 2025",
        "version": null,
        "text": "Costs\n(10)\nManagers must consider all costs, including costs relating to leave, superannuation, workers compensation, payroll tax and administrative costs before discussing secondment proposals."
    },
    {
        "chunk_id": "52-8",
        "document_id": "52",
        "policy_title": "Secondment Procedure",
        "heading_level": "h3",
        "section": "Section 5 - Procedures",
        "subsection": null,
        "topic": "Return to substantive position",
        "subtopic": null,
        "paragraph_start": 11,
        "paragraph_end": 12,
        "source_url": "https://policies.latrobe.edu.au/document/view.php?id=52",
        "status_details_url": "https://policies.latrobe.edu.au/document/status-and-details.php?id=52",
        "status": "Current",
        "effective_date": "4th July 2025",
        "review_date": "4th July 2028",
        "approval_authority": "Vice-Chancellor",
        "approval_date": "4th July 2025",
        "version": null,
        "text": "Return to substantive position\n(11)\nStaff members on secondment will normally return to their substantive positions at the end of the agreed secondment period and no future offer of another position or level can be made prior to the completion of the secondment.\n(12)\nThe staff member may resume in their previously held position before the date\\of expiry of the internal secondment with the approval of the same authorities appropriate to the secondment."
    },
    {
        "chunk_id": "52-9",
        "document_id": "52",
        "policy_title": "Secondment Procedure",
        "heading_level": "h4",
        "section": "Section 5 - Procedures",
        "subsection": null,
        "topic": "Return to substantive position",
        "subtopic": "Substantive position no longer exists",
        "paragraph_start": 13,
        "paragraph_end": 14,
        "source_url": "https://policies.latrobe.edu.au/document/view.php?id=52",
        "status_details_url": "https://policies.latrobe.edu.au/document/status-and-details.php?id=52",
        "status": "Current",
        "effective_date": "4th July 2025",
        "review_date": "4th July 2028",
        "approval_authority": "Vice-Chancellor",
        "approval_date": "4th July 2025",
        "version": null,
        "text": "Substantive position no longer exists\n(13)\nIn cases of structural changes during the course of the secondment, the substantive position may no longer exist, or be substantially altered.\n(14)\nIn such instances, the individual who has been seconded must be included in any consultation process and the area of origin must comply with the redundancy provisions of the\nEnterprise Agreement\n."
    },
    {
        "chunk_id": "52-10",
        "document_id": "52",
        "policy_title": "Secondment Procedure",
        "heading_level": "h3",
        "section": "Section 5 - Procedures",
        "subsection": null,
        "topic": "Filling the vacated position",
        "subtopic": null,
        "paragraph_start": 15,
        "paragraph_end": 15,
        "source_url": "https://policies.latrobe.edu.au/document/view.php?id=52",
        "status_details_url": "https://policies.latrobe.edu.au/document/status-and-details.php?id=52",
        "status": "Current",
        "effective_date": "4th July 2025",
        "review_date": "4th July 2028",
        "approval_authority": "Vice-Chancellor",
        "approval_date": "4th July 2025",
        "version": null,
        "text": "Filling the vacated position\n(15)\nThe vacated position may only be filled on a fixed term basis to a date no later than the last day of the internal secondment period, unless it is agreed between the area of origin and the staff member that at the end of the period of secondment the staff member will not return to their previous position."
    },
    {
        "chunk_id": "52-11",
        "document_id": "52",
        "policy_title": "Secondment Procedure",
        "heading_level": "h3",
        "section": "Section 5 - Procedures",
        "subsection": null,
        "topic": "Probation",
        "subtopic": null,
        "paragraph_start": 16,
        "paragraph_end": 16,
        "source_url": "https://policies.latrobe.edu.au/document/view.php?id=52",
        "status_details_url": "https://policies.latrobe.edu.au/document/status-and-details.php?id=52",
