        "approval_authority": "Vice-Chancellor",
        "approval_date": "4th July 2025",
        "version": null,
        "text": "Probation\n(16)\nProbation provisions do not apply to internal secondment arrangements."
    },
    {
        "chunk_id": "52-12",
        "document_id": "52",
        "policy_title": "Secondment Procedure",
        "heading_level": "h3",
        "section": "Section 5 - Procedures",
        "subsection": null,
        "topic": "Job Card and Approval",
        "subtopic": null,
        "paragraph_start": 17,
        "paragraph_end": 19,
        "source_url": "https://policies.latrobe.edu.au/document/view.php?id=52",
        "status_details_url": "https://policies.latrobe.edu.au/document/status-and-details.php?id=52",
        "status": "Current",
        "effective_date": "4th July 2025",
        "review_date": "4th July 2028",
        "approval_authority": "Vice-Chancellor",
        "approval_date": "4th July 2025",
        "version": null,
        "text": "Job Card and Approval\n(17)\nThe area of origin must raise a Job Card for approval advising the details of the internal secondment.\n(18)\nThe Job Card (which will go through the relevant workflows, requires final approval from the Vice-Chancellor.\n(19)\nFor more information please refer to:\nhttps://intranet.latrobe.edu.au/human-resources/talent-acquisition-and-remuneration/recruitment/secondments"
    },
    {
        "chunk_id": "52-13",
        "document_id": "52",
        "policy_title": "Secondment Procedure",
        "heading_level": "h3",
        "section": "Section 5 - Procedures",
        "subsection": null,
        "topic": "External Secondments – Remuneration and Benefits",
        "subtopic": null,
        "paragraph_start": 20,
        "paragraph_end": 23,
        "source_url": "https://policies.latrobe.edu.au/document/view.php?id=52",
        "status_details_url": "https://policies.latrobe.edu.au/document/status-and-details.php?id=52",
        "status": "Current",
        "effective_date": "4th July 2025",
        "review_date": "4th July 2028",
        "approval_authority": "Vice-Chancellor",
        "approval_date": "4th July 2025",
        "version": null,
        "text": "External Secondments – Remuneration and Benefits\n(20)\nAn external secondment is a temporary movement of a staff member from the University to an outside organisation.\n(21)\nGenerally an external secondment initiated by an individual is a period of leave without pay for service and leave purposes. In an external secondment the staff member will be responsible for superannuation payment arrangements as with leave without pay (see\nLeave Entitlements Policy\n).\n(22)\nThe receiving institution will pay the salary, travel and other costs of the seconded member.\n(23)\nFor secondments initiated by the University see\nPaid Additional Work Within the University - Full Time Staff Procedure\n)."
    },
    {
        "chunk_id": "52-14",
