        "approval_authority": "Vice-Chancellor",
        "approval_date": "4th July 2025",
        "version": null,
        "text": "Section 6 - Definitions\n(24)\nFor the purpose of this Procedure:\nSecondee: a person who performs the duties of another position for a specified period of time.\nUnit Manager:\nDeans or duly appointed delegate;\nHeads of Department or duly appointed delegate;\nSupervisors or duly appointed delegate; and/or\nManagers or duly appointed delegate."
    },
